  "notes": "Name as written in the announcement (Gemini-1.5-Flash-002). The release notes say gemini-1.5-flash-latest pointed to this version from 2024-09-24 and gemini-1.5-flash from 2024-11-21. The announcement says the update builds on the experimental releases of the preceding weeks (gemini-1.5-flash-exp-0827 in the release notes, kept as a candidate alias). Input modalities and context window are not restated in the -002 sources, so they are left out; see google.gemini-1-5-flash. No deprecation announcement date was found in live sources."
